### `defaultRoute`
<a id="on-bad-url"></a>

Fastify uses [find-my-way](https://github.com/delvedor/find-my-way) which supports,
can pass a default route with the option defaultRoute.

```js
const fastify = require('fastify')({
  routerOptions: {
    defaultRoute: (req, res) => {
      res.statusCode = 404
      res.end()
    }
  }
})
```

